WEBVTT

00:04.527 --> 00:08.127
The Gulf of Thailand did not warn a man
before it broke him;

00:08.637 --> 00:12.147
it simply shifted its weight,
and the horizon vanished.

00:12.790 --> 00:14.850
Ooh, that sounds exciting.

00:15.120 --> 00:16.350
Tide & Shadow.

00:16.680 --> 00:19.440
An original novella from Thai GL Weekly.

00:19.970 --> 00:21.890
Coming soon to Amazon Kindle.
